  * with the lowest levels (perf index 1 = 160 MHz, bw index 1) where Linux starts at the top,
  * then a8xx_gmu_gx_is_on (PWR_CLK_STATUS & 3 == 0); only then RBBM_STATUS (A8XX 0x012) is
